      "Text": "This update for yast2-users fixes the following issue:\n\nUpdate to version 4.6.7.\n\n- CVE-2026-59680: OS command injection via LDAP-supplied `shadowLastChange`/`shadowExpire` attribute (bsc#1272839).\n",
